{%- comment -%}
  Section contract.
  AVAILABLE TODAY vs COMING NEXT. Edit this list whenever a capability is verified live;
  nothing moves to "Available today" until it actually works for customers.
{%- endcomment -%}
<section id="status">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-h">
      <h2>What you can use today, and what's coming next.</h2>
      <p>We only list something as available once it works for customers.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="avail">
      <div class="card av">
        <span class="st st-live">Available today</span>
        <h3>Store Audit</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><span>48-Hour E-Commerce Revenue &amp; Automation Audit</span><span>$297</span></li>
          <li><span>Health Score across 13 areas</span><span>In the report</span></li>
          <li><span>3 things to fix today, plus a ranked plan</span><span>In the report</span></li>
          <li><span>Read-only review of Shopify stores</span><span>Shopify</span></li>
          <li><span>Secure checkout</span><span>Stripe</span></li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-p" href="/pages/store-auditor" style="margin-top:20px">Start my audit</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card av">
        <span class="st st-soon">Coming next</span>
        <h3>The platform</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><span>Operating view: revenue, margin, ads, inventory, fulfillment</span><span>In development</span></li>
          <li><span>Shopify connection</span><span>In development</span></li>
          <li><span>Automated alerts and recommendations</span><span>Coming next</span></li>
          <li><span>Ad platform connections (Meta, Google)</span><span>Planned</span></li>
          <li><span>Store building tools</span><span>Planned</span></li>
          <li><span>Foundation, Growth, and Scale plans</span><span>Early access</span></li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-g" href="/pages/demo" style="margin-top:20px">Join early access</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Cuadra · Available today",
  "presets": [ { "name": "Cuadra · Available today" } ]
}
{% endschema %}
